                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14356684" author="vozerov" created="Wed, 11 Mar 2015 10:32:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In addition, put() returns &apos;true&apos; in async mode. We need to return NULL here to be consistent with sync API.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14356742" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 11 Mar 2015 11:31:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;putAll()/removeAll() are fixed to return null.&lt;br/&gt;
For async put internal API is &apos;IgniteInternalFuture&amp;lt;Boolean&amp;gt; putxAsync(K key, V val, @Nullable CacheEntryPredicate... filter)&apos; so it can return false if filter does not pass. We have &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-347&quot; title=&quot;Cleanup internal cache API&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-347&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-347&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to cleanup internal API, I would change async &apos;put&apos; as part of this cleanup.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
